import Mathlib

/-
Leonard (1973), Erdős #915 / JSP-000759.
A graph on 57 vertices with 141 edges and no five distinct internally
vertex-disjoint simple paths between distinct endpoints.

Graph and cut data are explicit. All finite checks use Lean kernel reduction.
The 1596 cuts are checked in batches of at most 29 pairs. A checked closed
vertex set witnesses non-reachability after removing each separator and,
for adjacent endpoints, their direct edge. No external computation is trusted.
-/


